 "name": "PG - Keep in Touch Drafts",
 "description": "Sandbox, manual, draft-only. Builds check-in drafts for active past contacts with guards: opted-out/replied skip, 90-day gap, 3-touch cap, no duplicate pending draft, valid email. Never sends. No referral/review ask.",
